{"lyrics":"[00:14.34]D.A. got that\n[00:15.56]D.A. got that dope\n[00:17.26]I turn the news on when I smell death in the air\n[00:20.56]I prove you wrong, I made it out of here\n[00:24.40]I don't belong, I see my past everywhere\n[00:28.64]Don't stand too close to me, eternal PTSD\n[00:32.80]I got a war zone inside of my head\n[00:36.74]I made it on my own, they said I'd be in jail or dead\n[00:40.76]I've seen my brothers fall over and over again\n[00:44.78]Don't stand too close to me, I got PTSD\n[00:49.12]I was hearing bangs like Chief Keef\n[00:51.10]Always yelling names that's deceased\n[00:53.18]I go off my mind and my instinct (And my instinct)\n[00:54.88]Shootin' at the same time, we was in sync\n[00:57.20]On the same thing, tryna repeat\n[00:58.96]We was in them whips, right back on the enemies\n[01:00.68]Stuffed on my last hit, I was in the middle seat\n[01:02.70]Fuck it out the sun roof, brodie got a quick release\n[01:04.78]And we in a car real fast from police\n[01:06.72]Shots fired back, but his ass in the street\n[01:08.74]When I bought a forty, showed Brittany and Tiffany\n[01:10.74]Knowing if they call, it ain't shit they can't get from me\n[01:12.78]Lot of warfare, 17 had a 50 piece\n[01:14.78]Flexed on niggas so you know they wanna kill a G\n[01:16.84](Royalty) Posted in the hood with some Bentley keys\n[01:18.82](Loyalty) Roc died, showed 'em what it really mean\n[01:21.48]I can't sleep 'cause it's a war zone in my head\n[01:25.10]My killers good, they know I'm hands on with the bread\n[01:29.24]A million dollars ahead, I'm still angry and seeing red\n[01:33.68]How the fuck I'm 'posed to have fun? All my niggas dead\n[01:37.40]I turn the news on when I smell death in the air\n[01:40.98]I prove you wrong, I made it out of here\n[01:45.40]I don't belong, I see my past everywhere\n[01:49.32]Don't stand too close to me, eternal PTSD\n[01:52.70]I got a war zone inside of my head\n[01:57.44]I made it on my own, they said I'd be in jail or dead\n[01:59.88]I've seen my brothers fall over and over again (Hunh)\n[02:05.44]Don't stand too close to me (Igh), I got PTSD\n[02:08.84]Used to run home from the train stop (Yeah)\n[02:11.80]Running so fast, dodging raindrops (Huh-ah-huh-ah-huh)\n[02:13.76]'Member got robbed at the park once (Yeah)\n[02:15.52]'Member thinking that that bitch probably ain't cocked (Yeah)\n[02:17.58]'Member I was with my mama one time\n[02:19.08]Seen a nigga through the glass, hit a nigga with a bankshot (Bow)\n[02:21.60]Point-blank, head hanging off his tank top (Whoo)\n[02:23.74]Walked off, we drove off, went to GameStop (Skrrt)\n[02:27.38]Quiet ride there, picked up San Andreas (Hunh)\n[02:31.40]Certain things we ain't talk about, mama\n[02:32.96]We just prayed off\n[02:34.96]We seen it all, don't get involved\n[02:36.98]Carry the weight of the world like a shawl (Yeah)\n[02:38.86]Conceal and revealing to people in court\n[02:41.10]I still can feel it, I know that the world is evil\n[02:43.24]In case you thought a nigga forgot it\n[02:45.92]When my homie was bleeding out\n[02:47.30]Another homie went in his pockets (Tch)\n[02:50.06]Please do not run up on me, not even as fans\n[02:52.58]Niggas get fanned down on the Dan Ryan\n[02:54.96]I'm flying, I'm scary as hell, I need me a Xan (Igh)\n[02:57.64]The days seem long as life gets shorter\n[03:01.16]We know sex, drugs, money, all in that order\n[03:05.20]Ain't no structure, no peace, we've lost our order\n[03:09.48]Leaving me with anxiety, fucking up my sobriety (Lil Uzi Vert, yeah)\n[03:14.44]It's a war zone laying inside my head\n[03:18.44]I still think about all my niggas that's dead\n[03:22.34]I'm too paranoid, yeah, I know you heard what I said\n[03:25.96]I'm too paranoid, I make sure, all my opps, they bled (Woah)\n[03:29.94]Draining all my energy, no, I cannot sleep, uh-huh\n[03:33.98]I'm affected by the streets, no appetite, I can't eat\n[03:37.94]I only see red when I see, I think it's my PTSD (Yeah)\n[03:41.92]I think it's my PTSD (Woah), I think it's my PTSD, yeah (Woah)\n[03:46.84]I turn the news on when I smell death in the air","words":[[14.34,14.6,"D.A."],[14.82,15.06,"got"],[15.3,15.52,"that"],[15.56,16.26,"D.A."],[16.52,16.68,"got"],[16.76,16.96,"that"],[17.02,17.16,"dope"],[17.26,17.26,"I"],[17.32,17.72,"turn"],[17.78,17.88,"the"],[18.02,18.22,"news"],[18.26,18.28,"on"],[18.32,18.44,"when"],[18.56,18.56,"I"],[18.7,18.94,"smell"],[19.04,19.56,"death"],[19.62,19.8,"in"],[19.84,19.9,"the"],[20.16,20.5,"air"],[20.56,20.56,"I"],[20.8,21.22,"prove"],[21.32,21.6,"you"],[21.8,22.34,"wrong,"],[22.4,22.4,"I"],[22.58,22.94,"made"],[23.2,23.22,"it"],[23.42,23.56,"out"],[23.64,23.98,"of"],[24.06,24.2,"here"],[24.4,24.4,"I"],[24.86,25.2,"don't"],[25.38,26.4,"belong,"],[26.48,26.48,"I"],[26.64,26.8,"see"],[26.88,26.9,"my"],[27.12,27.64,"past"],[27.74,28.42,"everywhere"],[28.64,28.84,"Don't"],[28.88,29.08,"stand"],[29.12,29.28,"too"],[29.34,29.64,"close"],[29.68,29.74,"to"],[29.88,29.98,"me,"],[30.46,31.02,"eternal"],[31.12,31.92,"PTSD"],[32.8,32.8,"I"],[32.94,33.2,"got"],[33.26,33.26,"a"],[33.44,33.76,"war"],[33.9,34.74,"zone"],[34.8,35.72,"inside"],[35.76,35.78,"of"],[35.9,36.16,"my"],[36.24,36.48,"head"],[36.74,36.74,"I"],[36.94,37.24,"made"],[37.32,37.46,"it"],[37.58,37.64,"on"],[37.72,37.86,"my"],[38.08,38.22,"own,"],[38.26,38.34,"they"],[38.46,38.72,"said"],[38.8,38.88,"I'd"],[38.98,39.06,"be"],[39.22,39.36,"in"],[39.48,39.86,"jail"],[39.96,40.14,"or"],[40.24,40.7,"dead"],[40.76,40.92,"I've"],[40.96,41.18,"seen"],[41.24,41.38,"my"],[41.5,41.84,"brothers"],[41.98,42.2,"fall"],[42.6,42.96,"over"],[43.1,43.26,"and"],[43.46,43.98,"over"],[44.12,44.58,"again"],[44.78,44.96,"Don't"],[45.0,45.2,"stand"],[45.32,45.42,"too"],[45.48,45.76,"close"],[45.82,45.88,"to"],[46.0,46.1,"me,"],[46.96,46.96,"I"],[47.04,47.18,"got"],[47.3,48.06,"PTSD"],[49.12,49.12,"I"],[49.18,49.3,"was"],[49.36,49.52,"hearing"],[49.58,49.82,"bangs"],[49.88,50.02,"like"],[50.08,50.24,"Chief"],[50.34,50.54,"Keef"],[51.1,51.28,"Always"],